{"version":1,"content":"<p>【天啊 ... 😱】想像一下你正在玩 Call of Duty，屏幕突然被子彈擊中，心想這難道是 DirectX 13 特效，竟然如此真實？</p><p>一名玩家在 Reddit 上分享這段驚險經歷，在家中「打打下槍 Game」時外牆突然遭流彈射穿，子彈竟然被電腦屏幕擋下；</p><p>事後他大讚這款具備 280Hz 更新率的屏幕是他「這輩子花得最值得的 280 美元」。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T16:41:40.118899+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T16:24:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T09:19:39.187064+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T16:38:17.185639+00:00","content_hash":"e2aed19518af427c7f825c59a7a8aeaf960e9ad4e5a09cb2f960b9451f359b78","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}